    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47606" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tĕāte</span></b> , is,
			n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town on the Adriatic Sea</i>, <i>near
			Corfinium</i>, now <i>Chieti</i>, <i><span class="en">Sil. 8,
			521</span></i>; <i><span class="en">17,
			454</span></i>. — Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Tĕātīni</span></b> ,
				ōrum, m., <i>the inhabitants of Teate</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 3, 12,
				17, § 106</span></i>.</div>
